{"id":"n49272-1-8","stage":3,"title":"탁자 · 桌子","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49272-1-8-1","ko":"내 자동차 열쇠 못 봤어?","zh":"你没看到我的车钥匙吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"자동차","meaning":"汽车","explanation":"자동차：汽车","readings":[{"term":"자동차","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70799","senseId":"1","lemma":"자동차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자동차","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3"}},{"text":"열쇠","meaning":"钥匙","explanation":"열쇠：钥匙","readings":[{"term":"열쇠","audio":"/audio/5bebbcbf30ba30c05971.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26888","senseId":"1","lemma":"열쇠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열쇠","audio":"/audio/5bebbcbf30ba30c05971.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"没能、没有（못 보다：没看到）","explanation":"못：没能、没有（못 보다：没看到）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤어","audio":"/audio/0d4b5b0b4b8a9c03faf0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"716907a2f49c4260","term":"자동차","zh":"汽车","audio":"/audio/7